07.2021 - 03.2023 (8 months) - Junior UI/UX Designer | League Design Agency

In this position, I took part in work with more than 10 projects at different stages. In most projects, I was involved in partial implementation (several pages and separate blocks), and full implementation of three big projects:
- platform for dentists and orthodontists (two roles); - integration a smart home device control system into an existing app; - an application for registering for training with innovative simulators and monitoring nutrition (using integration with a third-party application).
