Moreinfo:
Analyst Assistant for Commodity Market Research (08.2020-06.2021)

Company: Best Automotive Technologies, Kyiv (Import and communication with trade branches about autoelectronic products and accessories)
My responsibilities included:
•	conducting sales in B2B model;
•	analysis of the plan / fact of sales;
•	using of various analytical tools: MS Excel tables with formulas and graphs, OLAP cubes, pivot tables;
•	creation of monthly reports in the form of presentations;
•	prompt search and collection of information on the Internet in Russian, Ukrainian, English;
•	monitoring and analysis of product residues in 27 branches throughout Ukraine;
•	generation and implementation of discounts + promotions on the company's website;
•	filling company`s website with content;
•	communication with business partners such as Rozetka, Autobaza, Prom;
•	writing technical requirements and briefing for contractors (designers and printing houses);
•	business correspondence with manufacturers in English (China, Taiwan);
•	preparation of documents for payment to suppliers;
•	work in 1C (different invoices, reports, directories, etc.);
•	interaction with the tech department and the service department.


Sales and Logistics Assistant AIF and AII divisions (07.2021)

Company: Atlas Copco Ukraine, Kyiv
My responsibilities included:
•	creating and editing cotracts with customers, according to terms;
•	calculating amounts payable according to exchange rate (euro-hryvnia);
•	creation and maintenance of documents (invoices, expenditure invoice, waybills, delivery notes, acts of acceptance);
•	communication with customers in written and oral forms;
•	monitoring the time of the readiness of goods at the factory;
•	formation of passports for equipment with serial numbers;
•	adding the equipment in C4C;
•	sending paper mail to customers;
•	ordering trucks for the delivery of goods throughout Ukraine;
•	leading a full cycle of an invoice in the SCALA;
•	full audit of all documents, signaturing of responsible persons, sealing;
•	monitoring all income payments;
•	solving all issues with salesmen of AIF and AII divisons;
•	preparation of tender documents.

