An ambitious UI/UX and Graphic Designer with stable experience in the design market, more than 4 years. I know how to create products that are as aesthetically pleasing as they are easy to use. I will do everything possible for the needs of the company to organize a comfortable atmosphere of cooperation. My design skills and professional experience will help you implement the most creative and risky ideas.

Stosyk | UI/UX designer
As part of the team, I helped create the Ukrainian startup Stosyk. 
The team was developing a web application that allows 
teachers to create lessons in the lesson designer and conduct 
classes with students, tracking how they cope with the tasks.
I contributed to the design of the web platform. This was my 
first experience working on a large-scale project as a UI\UX 
designer. The more difficult ones that arose during the creation 
of the platform were quickly solved thanks to my prompt 
mastering new skills.

English Monsters | Advertising Graphic Designer
I was engaged in designing social networks and creating 
advertising creatives for the English language school English 
Monsters. The result of my work had a good indicator because 
the first published creatives increased the page s reach by 20%.
My responsibilities included the creation of advertising 
creatives for the company s social networks. I created static and 
animated ads. I was in charge of coming up with ideas for 
writing advertising texts, preparing graphic elements for 
animation, searching for voiceover and sound effects, and 
managing the animation creation process.

KONTENT production | Graphic Web Designer
The scope of my work was creating the design of the face of the 
a brand with the help of digital packaging.
Namely: the development of websites, corporate identity, and printing products, as well as work on advertising creatives for social networks.

Moreinfo:
As a highly motivated UI/UX designer with 3+ years of experience and a passion for creating intuitive and impactful digital experiences, I bring a unique combination of technical skill and user-centered design to every project.

My previous work highlights include:
- Executing and iteration on visual designs from concept to high-fidelity designs using Figma;
- Experience with creating high-quality, responsive layouts with smooth interactions, transitions, and animations;
- Designing products with familiarity with SEO practices, accessibility standards, and templating;
- Creating and keep up to date the style guides and design system components;
- Researching customers, competitors, and products;
- Evaluating user research and insights, experience with usability testing and analytics tools;
- Creation of wireframes, user flows, & prototypes;
- Working closely with developers to bring designs to life, by creating design specs, reviewing development work, and checking for accuracy with design requirements.

I am driven by the desire to create digital products that make a difference in people's lives and I am committed to staying on the cutting edge of design trends and technologies.
Whether leading a project or working as part of a team, I am dedicated to delivering solutions that meet users' needs and lead to actual business results.

